  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of the project of which this contract will be a part is as follows: To strengthen capacity at federal and member state levels to shape and implement sound education policies and programmes that enhance provision of equitable and inclusive quality education for Somali children, youth and adults. (Refer to the Organisation and Methodology)&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
